      "notes": "Tables read by tools/profiles/korg/read-korg-text.mjs from monologue_MIDIimp.txt (sha256 139e399a493a964d67294eca4f937426fc3680f96f002c2379f4648c0658c3d2), https://www.korg.com/us/support/download/manual/0/733/4231/. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
