  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/korg/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/korg/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a control change the document says the instrument recognises, or a row of its NRPN table, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "CC 59 (LFO MODE) takes the values the instrument sends (2-6): the receive table points at *5-6, which the document does not print.",
    "Not a parameter here, a channel mode message: CC 120, 122, 123.",
    "Pull: CURRENT PROGRAM DATA DUMP REQUEST, answered by the current program in Korg's 8-in-7 packing (448Bytes = 7*64 -> 8*64 => 512Bytes). 23 parameter(s) are read back from it by the program table's offsets; a controller parameter reads the top seven bits of its 10-bit field, the value its controller sends.",
    "The exclusive header carries the global MIDI channel as 3g; the profile's deviceId variable is that byte, 30H for channel 1.",
    "In the program dump but not read back: EG TARGET (the dump names a value \"PICTH 2\" the parameter has no choice for).",
    "In the program dump with no parameter of the same name here: KEYBOARD OCTAVE, SEQ TRIG, PROGRAM TUNING, MICRO TUNING, Scale Key, Slide Time, Portament Time, Slider Assign, Bend Range (+), Bend Range (-), Portament Mode, Lfo BPM Sync, Cutoff Velocity, Cutoff Key Track, Program Level, Amp Velocity, BPM, Step Length, Step Resolutin, Swing, Default Gate Time, Step 1 Off/On, Step 2 Off/On, Step 3 Off/On, Step 4 Off/On, Step 5 Off/On, Step 6 Off/On, Step 7 Off/On, Step 8 Off/On, Step 9 Off/On, Step 10 Off/On, Step 11 Off/On, Step 12 Off/On, Step 13 Off/On, Step 14 Off/On, Step 15 Off/On, Step 16 Off/On, Step 1 Motion Off/On, Step 2 Motion Off/On, Step 3 Motion Off/On, Step 4 Motion Off/On, Step 5 Motion Off/On, Step 6 Motion Off/On, Step 7 Motion Off/On, Step 8 Motion Off/On, Step 9 Motion Off/On, Step 10 Motion Off/On, Step 11 Motion Off/On, Step 12 Motion Off/On, Step 13 Motion Off/On, Step 14 Motion Off/On, Step 15 Motion Off/On, Step 16 Motion Off/On, Step 1 Slide Off/On, Step 2 Slide Off/On, Step 3 Slide Off/On, Step 4 Slide Off/On, Step 5 Slide Off/On, Step 6 Slide Off/On, Step 7 Slide Off/On, Step 8 Slide Off/On, Step 9 Slide Off/On, Step 10 Slide Off/On, Step 11 Slide Off/On, Step 12 Slide Off/On, Step 13 Slide Off/On, Step 14 Slide Off/On, Step 15 Slide Off/On, Step 16 Slide Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 1 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 2 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 3 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 4 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 5 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 6 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 7 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 8 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 9 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 10 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 11 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 12 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 13 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 14 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 15 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 16 Off/On."
